Package: libimgvision1
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: High-performance YOLO + OCR image analysis library
 Imgvision is a C/C++ shared library that combines Darknet/YOLO object
 detection with Tesseract OCR for high-performance image analysis.
 The library exposes a thread-safe API for classification and text extraction.

Package: libimgvision-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Depends: libimgvision1 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}, libtesseract-dev, libopencv-dev
Description: Development files for imgvision YOLO + OCR library
 Header files, pkg-config metadata and import libraries for imgvision.
 Install this package to build applications against libimgvision.

Package: imgvision-examples
Section: utils
Architecture: any
Depends: libimgvision1 (>= ${binary:Version}), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Example program for imgvision YOLO + OCR library
 Installs a small example program that demonstrates how to call the
 imgvision API to run YOLO classification and Tesseract OCR.
